25	 * detection is consolidated into the owner's {@link Owner#getIdentityKey() identity key}
26	 * (telephone, email and household id combined): a candidate is a duplicate only when an
27	 * existing owner carries the exact same identity key. Because the telephone is part of the
28	 * key, owners that differ in any one of those parts — including two members of the same
29	 * household with different telephones — have distinct keys and are not duplicates.
30	 */
31	@Component
